Package: waxlight
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Waxlight contributors <noreply@waxlight.local>
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Homepage: https://github.com/AmadoMuerte/Waxlight-launcher
Description: Unofficial launcher for Vintage Story
 Waxlight Launcher manages isolated game instances, installed game versions,
 accounts, mods, launch operations, and playtime statistics.
